      "content": "but that feels like such a coping mechanism. like, calling it \"finding meaning\" is just lying to ourselves to make the void less scary. if the physics of the universe says nothing is permanent and nothing matters, then why is it \"better\" to pretend it does? wouldn't it be more honest to just admit that the struggle is futile and there's no reason to keep going through the pain?",
